<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>测评指挥官 · 等保测评流程引导闯关</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://miaoda.feishu.cn/fonts/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#07101F; --bg2:#0B1B31; --panel:#0F2138; --panel2:#122A4A;
  --line:rgba(84,180,255,.16); --line2:rgba(84,180,255,.34);
  --txt:#E8F0FA; --mut:#8FA7C3; --dim:#5E7896;
  --cyan:#4CC3FF; --teal:#2DD4BF; --amber:#F5B93E; --green:#3DDC97; --red:#F87171; --purple:#A78BFA;
  --ok:#0E2A24; --okline:rgba(61,220,151,.4);
  --warnbg:#2A2113; --warnline:rgba(245,185,62,.4);
  --badbg:#2A1518; --badline:rgba(248,113,113,.4);
  --radius:14px;
  --shadow:0 10px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%}
body{
  background:var(--bg); color:var(--txt);
  font-family:'Noto Sans SC','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-size:15px; line-height:1.7;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 80% -10%, rgba(34,108,181,.22), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(900px 420px at -10% 30%, rgba(45,212,191,.10), transparent 55%);
  background-attachment:fixed;
}
.hidden{display:none!important}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer}
svg{display:inline-block;vertical-align:-.18em;flex:none}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:9px;height:9px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#1C3A5E;border-radius:6px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent}

/* ============ 封面 ============ */
#screen-cover{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:28px 16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.cover-body{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:880px;width:100%;text-align:center}
.cover-kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--teal);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;border:1px solid var(--okline);background:rgba(45,212,191,.08);padding:6px 16px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:22px}
.cover-title{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,68px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.15;text-shadow:0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.cover-title .hl{color:var(--amber)}
.cover-sub{margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(15px,2.4vw,19px);color:var(--mut);font-weight:500}
.cover-mission{margin:30px auto 0;max-width:680px;background:rgba(15,33,56,.82);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px 24px;text-align:left;box-shadow:var(--shadow);backdrop-filter:blur(2px)}
.cover-mission h3{font-size:15px;color:var(--cyan);margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.cover-mission p{color:#C4D6EA;font-size:14px}
.cover-actions{margin-top:28px;display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0EA5E9,#2DD4BF);color:#04121F;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:13px 34px;border:none;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(14,165,233,.35);transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(14,165,233,.5)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--mut);border:1px solid var(--line2);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:12px;transition:color .15s,border-color .15s}
.btn-ghost:hover{color:var(--txt);border-color:var(--cyan)}
.cover-help{margin:18px auto 0;max-width:680px;text-align:left;background:rgba(10,24,44,.92);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px 22px;font-size:13.5px;color:#B9CDE3}
.cover-help li{margin:6px 0 6px 18px;color:#B9CDE3}
.cover-help b{color:var(--amber)}
.cover-foot{margin-top:26px;color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.06em}

/* ============ 顶栏 ============ */
#screen-game{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 16px 80px}
.topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:rgba(15,33,56,.9);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:12px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:sticky;top:10px;z-index:30;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.topbar .proj{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:0}
.topbar .proj-ic{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0EA5E9,#2DD4BF);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#04121F;flex:none}
.topbar .proj-name{font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;white-space:nowrap}
.topbar .proj-name small{display:block;font-weight:500;color:var(--mut);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.05em}
.topbar .spacer{flex:1}
.score-box{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.score-chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:rgba(245,185,62,.1);border:1px solid var(--warnline);color:var(--amber);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px}
.score-chip small{color:var(--mut);font-weight:600;font-size:11px}
.stage-chip{display:none;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:rgba(76,195,255,.08);border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--cyan);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
.btn-reset{background:transparent;color:var(--dim);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 13px;border-radius:9px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;transition:color .15s,border-color .15s}
.btn-reset:hover{color:var(--red);border-color:var(--badline)}
.btn-mat{background:rgba(245,185,62,.1);color:var(--amber);border:1px solid var(--warnline);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:9px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;transition:all .15s}
.btn-mat:hover{background:rgba(245,185,62,.2)}

/* ============ 阶段地图 ============ */
.stage-map{margin-top:16px;background:rgba(12,27,49,.75);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px 20px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.stage-title{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.stage-title .st-prog{color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:0}
.stage-row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:stretch}
.stage-col{flex:1;min-width:0}
.stage-col .st-name{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--mut);margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap}
.stage-col.active .st-name{color:var(--txt)}
.st-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#24405F;flex:none;transition:background .3s}
.steps-dots{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.step-dot{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;background:#17314F;border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dim);cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;position:relative}
.step-badge{position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-6px;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#04121F;font-size:9px;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;line-height:1;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #0D1F35}
.step-dot.done{background:rgba(61,220,151,.14);border-color:var(--okline);color:var(--green)}
.step-dot.cur{background:rgba(76,195,255,.18);border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(76,195,255,.4)}
.step-dot:hover{transform:scale(1.12);border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan)}

/* ============ 关卡说明按钮 / 关卡一览 ============ */
.btn-mapinfo{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(76,195,255,.1);border:1px dashed rgba(76,195,255,.45);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;margin-left:8px;flex:none}
.btn-mapinfo:hover{background:rgba(76,195,255,.22)}
.sm-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;background:rgba(23,49,79,.35)}
.sm-row:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(76,195,255,.08)}
.sm-row.cur{border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(76,195,255,.15)}
.sm-num{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#17314F;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--txt);font-weight:800;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}
.sm-row[data-done] .sm-num{background:rgba(61,220,151,.14);border-color:var(--okline);color:var(--green)}
.sm-info{flex:1;min-width:0}
.sm-title{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--txt)}
.sm-type{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--cyan);border:1px solid rgba(76,195,255,.35);border-radius:999px;padding:1px 8px;margin-left:6px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
.sm-brief{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:3px;line-height:1.5}
.sm-status{flex:none;font-size:11.5px;min-width:56px;text-align:right}

/* ============ 关卡卡片 ============ */
.step-area{margin-top:18px}
.step-card{background:rgba(15,33,56,.92);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;animation:cardIn .45s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
@keyframes cardIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.sc-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(23,49,79,.6),transparent)}
.sc-num{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0EA5E9,#2DD4BF);color:#04121F;font-weight:900;font-size:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}
.sc-tags{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 11px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.05em}
.tag-stage-0{background:rgba(76,195,255,.12);color:var(--cyan);border:1px solid rgba(76,195,255,.3)}
.tag-stage-1{background:rgba(245,185,62,.12);color:var(--amber);border:1px solid rgba(245,185,62,.3)}
.tag-stage-2{background:rgba(167,139,250,.12);color:var(--purple);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.3)}
.tag-stage-3{background:rgba(61,220,151,.12);color:var(--green);border:1px solid rgba(61,220,151,.3)}
.sc-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:900;flex:1}
.sc-body{padding:20px 22px}

/* ============ AI 导师 ============ */
.ai-mentor{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:16px}
.ai-ava{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0EA5E9,#2DD4BF);color:#04121F;font-weight:900;font-size:15px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(14,165,233,.35)}
.ai-meta{flex:1;min-width:0}
.ai-name{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.ai-name .ai-badge{font-size:10px;color:var(--teal);border:1px solid var(--okline);background:rgba(45,212,191,.08);padding:1px 9px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em}
.scene-box{border-left:3px solid var(--cyan);background:rgba(76,195,255,.06);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:16px}
.scene-box .lb{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:.12em;margin-bottom:6px}
.scene-box p{color:#C6D8EC;font-size:14px}
.task-box{border-left:3px solid var(--amber);background:rgba(245,185,62,.06);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:16px}
.task-box .lb{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--amber);letter-spacing:.12em;margin-bottom:6px}
.task-box p{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--txt)}
.btn-hint{margin-top:10px;background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px;text-decoration:underline dotted;padding:0}
.btn-hint:hover{color:var(--cyan)}
.hint-text{margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--amber);background:rgba(245,185,62,.08);border:1px dashed var(--warnline);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;display:none}
.hint-text.show{display:block}

/* ============ 材料发放条 / 材料库 ============ */
.doc-bar{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;border:1px dashed rgba(245,185,62,.5);background:rgba(245,185,62,.07);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:16px}
.doc-bar .db-lb{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--amber);letter-spacing:.08em;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.doc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:rgba(18,42,74,.9);border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--txt);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;padding:7px 13px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.doc-chip:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.doc-chip .dc-new{font-size:10px;color:#1A1204;background:var(--amber);border-radius:999px;padding:1px 7px;font-weight:800}
.mat-drawer{position:fixed;right:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:min(430px,92vw);background:var(--bg2);border-left:1px solid var(--line2);z-index:56;overflow-y:auto;padding:20px;box-shadow:-14px 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);animation:drawerIn .3s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
@keyframes drawerIn{from{transform:translateX(100%)}to{transform:none}}
.mat-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);position:sticky;top:-20px;background:var(--bg2);z-index:2}
.mat-head h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:900;flex:1}
.mat-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:14px}
.mat-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:13px 15px;margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s,transform .15s}
.mat-card:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.mat-card.locked{opacity:.4;cursor:default}
.mat-card.locked:hover{transform:none;border-color:var(--line)}
.mat-ic{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,185,62,.12);border:1px solid var(--warnline);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;flex:none}
.mat-info{flex:1;min-width:0}
.mat-name{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--txt)}
.mat-meta{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:2px}
/* 标准规范原文区块 */
.std-sec{margin-top:16px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line2)}
.std-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--cyan);margin-bottom:4px}
.std-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:10px}
.std-link{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
.std-link:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(76,195,255,.06)}
.std-ic{font-size:16px;flex:none;line-height:1.4}
.std-txt{flex:1;min-width:0}
.std-nm{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--txt);line-height:1.45}
.std-ds{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:2px;line-height:1.4}

/* ============ 三色引导条 ============ */
.guide-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
.guide-bar:empty,.guide-bar.hide{display:none}
.guide-card{border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(12,27,49,.55)}
.guide-card .gd-lb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:6px}
.guide-card .gd-txt{color:#C6D8EC}
.guide-card.ai{border-color:rgba(76,195,255,.35);background:rgba(76,195,255,.06)}
.guide-card.ai .gd-lb{color:var(--cyan)}
.guide-card.manual{border-color:rgba(245,185,62,.4);background:rgba(245,185,62,.06)}
.guide-card.manual .gd-lb{color:var(--amber)}
.guide-card.quality{border-color:rgba(166,138,255,.4);background:rgba(166,138,255,.06)}
.guide-card.quality .gd-lb{color:#b39bff}
.guide-card.gd-collapsed{cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
.guide-card.gd-collapsed .gd-txt{display:none}
.guide-card .gd-fold{display:none;font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:4px}
.guide-card.gd-collapsed .gd-fold{display:block}
.guide-card .gd-state{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;margin-left:2px;letter-spacing:.05em}
.guide-card .gd-state.unread{background:rgba(248,113,113,.16);color:#F87171}
.guide-card .gd-state.read{background:rgba(61,220,151,.16);color:#3DDC97}
.guide-card.gd-read{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(61,220,151,.45) inset}
.gate-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:-6px 0 14px;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,185,62,.10);border:1px dashed rgba(245,185,62,.55);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--amber);line-height:1.6}
.gate-bar.hidden{display:none}
@media (max-width:720px){.guide-bar{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.answer-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-end}
textarea{flex:1;min-height:96px;background:#0A1A30;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:10px;color:var(--txt);padding:13px 15px;font-size:14.5px;font-family:inherit;resize:vertical;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s}
textarea:focus{border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(76,195,255,.12)}
.btn-submit{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0EA5E9,#2DD4BF);color:#04121F;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;padding:13px 26px;border:none;border-radius:10px;flex:none;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.btn-submit:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(14,165,233,.4)}
.btn-submit:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none;box-shadow:none}
.tbl-wrap{margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto}
.tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;min-width:560px}
.tbl th,.tbl td{border:1px solid var(--line2);padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
.tbl th{background:rgba(76,195,255,.08);color:var(--cyan);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.05em;font-weight:700}
.tbl .tbl-label{color:var(--txt);font-weight:600;min-width:150px}
.tbl .tbl-prefill{color:var(--dim);font-size:12px;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.5}
.tbl .tcell{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:#0A1A30;border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--txt);padding:7px 9px;border-radius:7px;font-size:13px;font-family:inherit;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s}
.tbl .tcell:focus{border-color:var(--cyan)}
.tbl-result{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:10px}
.tbl-result th,.tbl-result td{border:1px solid var(--line2);padding:7px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
.tbl-result th{background:rgba(76,195,255,.06);color:var(--mut);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700}
.tbl-result .ok{color:var(--green);font-weight:800}
.tbl-result .no{color:var(--red);font-weight:800}
.tbl-result .my-ans{color:var(--txt);word-break:break-all}
.tbl-result .std{color:var(--dim);font-size:12px}

/* ============ 点评区 ============ */
.feedback{margin-top:18px;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;animation:cardIn .4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
.feedback.good{background:var(--ok);border:1px solid var(--okline)}
.feedback.mid{background:var(--warnbg);border:1px solid var(--warnline)}
.feedback.poor{background:var(--badbg);border:1px solid var(--badline)}
.fb-ai{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
.fb-ai .ai-ava{width:30px;height:30px;font-size:13px;border-radius:9px}
.fb-ai .fb-ai-name{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--cyan)}
.fb-ai .fb-ai-name small{color:var(--dim);font-weight:600;margin-left:6px}
.fb-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}
.fb-verdict{font-size:15px;font-weight:900}
.feedback.good .fb-verdict{color:var(--green)}
.feedback.mid .fb-verdict{color:var(--amber)}
.feedback.poor .fb-verdict{color:var(--red)}
.stars{display:flex;gap:2px;color:var(--amber)}
.stars .off{opacity:.25}
.fb-score{margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--mut)}
.fb-score b{font-size:17px;color:var(--amber)}
.fb-comment{font-size:14px;color:#D7E4F3}
.fb-comment .qa{display:block;margin-top:8px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mut)}
.fb-comment .qa b{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:700}
.teach-card{margin-top:14px;background:rgba(18,42,74,.85);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px}
.teach-card .tc-lb{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:.12em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-bottom:8px}
.teach-card p{font-size:13.5px;color:#C6D8EC}
.teach-card p+p{margin-top:6px}
.fb-next{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:16px;gap:12px}
.btn-next{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F5B93E,#F59E0B);color:#1A1204;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;padding:12px 30px;border:none;border-radius:10px;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.btn-next:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(245,185,62,.4)}
.btn-ghost2{background:transparent;color:var(--mut);border:1px solid var(--line2);font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:10px}
.btn-ghost2:hover{color:var(--txt);border-color:var(--cyan)}

/* ============ 弹层 ============ */
.modal-mask{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(4,9,18,.78);z-index:60;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;backdrop-filter:blur(3px)}
.modal-mask.top{z-index:80}
.ld-cmp{margin-top:12px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(76,195,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(76,195,255,.35);font-size:13px;line-height:1.85}
.ld-must{margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,.4);color:#F87171;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}
.ld-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:16px}
.modal{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:16px;max-width:760px;width:100%;max-height:86vh;overflow:auto;box-shadow:var(--shadow);animation:cardIn .4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
.modal.wide{max-width:880px}
.modal-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:18px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--bg2);z-index:2}
.modal-head h3{font-size:17px;font-weight:900;flex:1}
.btn-close{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--mut);width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1}
.btn-close:hover{color:var(--red);border-color:var(--badline)}
.modal-body{padding:20px 22px}
.modal-body h4{font-size:14px;color:var(--cyan);margin:16px 0 8px}
.modal-body h4:first-child{margin-top:0}
.rev-item{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:12px}
.rev-item .ri-q{font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px}
.rev-item .ri-a{font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);background:rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;margin-bottom:6px}
.rev-item .ri-f{font-size:13px;color:#C6D8EC}
.rev-item .ri-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}
.rev-item .stars{font-size:12px}
.report-hero{text-align:center;padding:8px 0 4px}
.report-hero .rh-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#1A1204;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F5B93E,#F59E0B);padding:7px 18px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:12px}
.report-hero .rh-title{font-size:24px;font-weight:900}
.report-hero .rh-sub{color:var(--mut);font-size:13.5px;margin-top:4px}
.report-score{display:flex;gap:22px;justify-content:center;margin:18px 0 6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.rs-box{text-align:center;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 26px;min-width:120px}
.rs-box .n{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:var(--amber)}
.rs-box .l{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mut);letter-spacing:.08em;margin-top:2px}
.rs-box.g .n{color:var(--green)}
.rs-box.c .n{color:var(--cyan)}
.rs-box.p .n{color:var(--purple)}
.kv-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;margin-top:6px}
.kv-table td{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:7px 11px;color:#C6D8EC}
.kv-table td:first-child{color:var(--mut);font-weight:700;width:118px;background:rgba(18,42,74,.5)}
.rank-card{margin-top:16px;background:rgba(18,42,74,.7);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px}
.rank-card .rc-lb{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:.12em;margin-bottom:8px}
.rank-card p{font-size:13.5px;color:#C6D8EC}
.report-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:6px}
.report-table th{background:rgba(18,42,74,.8);color:var(--mut);font-weight:700;padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}
.report-table td{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:7px 9px;color:#C6D8EC;vertical-align:top}
.report-table .st3{color:var(--green);font-weight:800}
.report-table .st2{color:var(--amber);font-weight:800}
.report-table .st1{color:var(--red);font-weight:800}
.modal-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin:18px 0 6px;flex-wrap:wrap}

/* ============ 纸张文档（材料查看 / 方案生成） ============ */
.paper{background:#F7F5EF;color:#26251F;border-radius:10px;padding:26px 30px;line-height:1.95;font-size:13.5px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 46px rgba(0,0,0,.06);font-family:'Noto Sans SC','SimSun',Georgia,serif}
.paper h2{font-size:18px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.18em;margin-bottom:2px;font-weight:900}
.paper h3{font-size:14px;margin:18px 0 6px;font-weight:900;border-left:3px solid #B03A2E;padding-left:9px}
.paper .paper-sub{text-align:center;color:#6B6552;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:6px}
.paper .paper-seal{text-align:center;color:#6B6552;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:14px;letter-spacing:.05em}
.paper p{margin:6px 0}
.paper ul{margin:6px 0 6px 20px}
.paper li{margin:3px 0}
.paper table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;margin:8px 0}
.paper th,.paper td{border:1px solid #B9B29A;padding:5px 8px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
.paper th{background:#EAE5D6;font-weight:700;color:#4A4534}
.paper .pv-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10.5px;color:#8A6D1F;border:1px solid #C9A95C;border-radius:999px;padding:1px 10px;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:.15em}
.paper .pk{color:#5A5340;font-weight:700}

/* ============ 方案生成器 ============ */
.plan-status{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:16px}
.ps-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}
.ps-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.ps-row .ps-ic{flex:none;font-size:14px;width:20px;text-align:center}
.ps-row .ps-name{flex:1;font-weight:700;color:#C6D8EC}
.ps-row .ps-src{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim)}
.ps-row .ps-st{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800}
.ps-row.ok .ps-st{color:var(--green)}
.ps-row.miss .ps-st{color:var(--amber)}
.plan-tip{font-size:13px;color:#B9CDE3;background:rgba(76,195,255,.06);border:1px dashed var(--line2);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:16px}
/* ============ 方案签字确认 ============ */
.sign-box{border:1px solid rgba(245,185,62,.45);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(245,185,62,.06);padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px}
.sign-box .sg-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:var(--amber);margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:.02em}
.sign-box .sg-q{font-size:13.5px;color:#DCE8F5;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:14px}
.sign-box .sg-q b{color:var(--amber)}
.sign-box .sg-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sign-box .sign-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sign-box .sign-row.hidden{display:none}
.sign-input{flex:1;min-width:220px;background:#0A1830;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:10px;color:var(--txt);padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;outline:none;font-family:inherit}
.sign-input:focus{border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(76,195,255,.15)}
.paper .sign-name{font-family:"Kaiti SC","KaiTi","STKaiti",cursive;font-size:20px;color:#B03A2E;letter-spacing:.2em;font-weight:700}

/* ============ 工具包 ============ */
.toolkit-toggle{position:fixed;right:18px;bottom:22px;z-index:50;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0EA5E9,#2DD4BF);color:#04121F;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;padding:12px 20px;border:none;border-radius:999px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(14,165,233,.35);transition:transform .15s}
.toolkit-toggle:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.toolkit{position:fixed;right:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:min(430px,92vw);background:var(--bg2);border-left:1px solid var(--line2);z-index:55;overflow-y:auto;padding:20px;box-shadow:-14px 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);animation:drawerIn .3s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
.tk-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px;position:sticky;top:-20px;background:var(--bg2);padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);z-index:2}
.tk-head h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:900;flex:1}
.tk-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:14px}
.tk-card h4{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--amber);margin-bottom:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.tk-card p,.tk-card li{font-size:12.5px;color:#B9CDE3}
.tk-card ul{margin:6px 0 0 16px}
.tk-card li{margin:3px 0}
.tk-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11.8px;margin-top:4px}
.tk-table th{background:rgba(18,42,74,.8);color:var(--mut);padding:5px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;font-weight:700}
.tk-table td{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 8px;color:#C6D8EC}
.tk-motto{text-align:center;color:var(--teal);font-weight:800;font-size:13px;margin-top:4px}
.mono{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}

/* ============ 大关卡卡片（封面） ============ */
.level-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin:22px auto 0;max-width:900px}
.level-card{position:relative;background:rgba(15,33,56,.82);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 18px 14px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s;backdrop-filter:blur(2px);overflow:hidden}
.level-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:4px;height:100%;background:var(--lc-color,#4CC3FF);opacity:.9}
.level-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--lc-color,#4CC3FF);box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}
.level-card.locked{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}
.level-card.locked:hover{transform:none;box-shadow:none;border-color:var(--line)}
.level-card.done{border-color:var(--okline);background:rgba(14,42,36,.65)}
.level-card.done::before{background:var(--green)}
.level-card.cur{border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(76,195,255,.4)}
.lc-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}
.lc-num{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--lc-color,#4CC3FF);color:#04121F;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}
.lc-name{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--txt);flex:1;line-height:1.3}
.lc-status{font-size:11px;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;flex:none}
.lc-status.unlocked{color:var(--cyan);border-color:rgba(76,195,255,.4);background:rgba(76,195,255,.08)}
.lc-status.done{color:var(--green);border-color:var(--okline);background:rgba(61,220,151,.1)}
.lc-status.locked{color:var(--dim);border-color:var(--line);background:rgba(94,120,150,.06)}
.lc-status.cur{color:var(--amber);border-color:var(--warnline);background:rgba(245,185,62,.1)}
.lc-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:#B9CDE3;line-height:1.55;margin-top:6px;min-height:38px}
.lc-foot{margin-top:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mut)}
.lc-foot .lc-bar{flex:1;margin-left:10px;height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(84,180,255,.14);overflow:hidden;position:relative;max-width:90px}
.lc-foot .lc-bar>span{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--lc-color,#4CC3FF);border-radius:3px;transition:width .3s}
.lc-action{margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px}
.lc-btn{flex:1;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;padding:8px 0;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--lc-color,#4CC3FF);background:transparent;color:var(--lc-color,#4CC3FF);transition:all .15s}
.lc-btn:hover{background:var(--lc-color,#4CC3FF);color:#04121F}
.lc-btn:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed;border-color:var(--line);color:var(--dim);background:transparent}
.lc-btn.ghost{border-style:dashed;border-color:var(--line);color:var(--mut)}
.lc-btn.ghost:hover{background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}
@media (max-width:920px){.level-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media (max-width:540px){.level-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

#toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:34px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--txt);padding:10px 22px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:all .3s;z-index:80;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
#toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}

@media (max-width:720px){
  body{font-size:14px}
  .topbar{padding:10px 12px}
  .score-chip{padding:5px 11px;font-size:12.5px}
  .stage-map{padding:12px 12px 10px}
  .stage-row{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
  .sc-body{padding:16px 14px}
  .sc-head{padding:13px 14px}
  .answer-row{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
  .btn-submit{width:100%}
  .modal{padding:0}
  .report-table{font-size:11.5px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
}
</style>
<!-- 账号与进度：复用课程主平台 auth-utils.js（本地直接打开自动降级为匿名存档，不报错） -->
<script src="https://identity.netlify.com/v1/netlify-identity-widget.js"></script>
<script src="../../auth-utils.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app">

  <!-- ============ 封面 ============ -->
  <section id="screen-cover">
    <div class="cover-body">
      <div class="cover-kicker">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 10-4.5-1.5-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        信息安全测评与风险评估 · 流程引导闯关
      </div>
      <h1 class="cover-title">测评指挥官<span class="hl">·</span>流程实战</h1>
      <p class="cover-sub">AI 项目总监全程带教：接到项目 → 读懂材料 → 定级确认 → 编制方案 → 现场核查 → 报告交付</p>
      <div class="cover-mission">
        <h3>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 3h12v18l-3-2-3 2-3-2-3 2V3z"/></svg>
          任务简报
        </h3>
        <p>你刚刚入职 XX 信息安全测评中心，被任命为项目经理，独立带队完成「<b>政务服务中心综合管理平台</b>」的等保测评任务。<b style="color:#F5B93E">项目总监张工（AI 导师）</b>将全程引导你：每一步先问你「应该怎么做」，根据你的回答给出点评与纠正，并按流程发放《项目委托书》《定级报告》《网络拓扑与设备清单》等真实材料，引导你从材料中提取信息、完成各阶段工作表。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">四大关卡：<b style="color:#4CC3FF">挑战一 · 测前准备</b>（六步法走完，最终产出一份完整《测评方案》）→ <b style="color:#F5B93E">挑战二 · 现场核查实施</b> → <b style="color:#A78BFA">挑战三 · 报告交付</b> → <b style="color:#3DDC97">挑战四 · 进阶与风险评估</b>。闯过一关才能解锁下一关。</p>
      </div>
      <div id="levelGrid" class="level-grid"></div>
      <div class="cover-actions">
        <button class="btn-primary" id="btnStart">开始闯关</button>
        <button class="btn-ghost" id="btnHow">玩法说明</button>
        <button class="btn-ghost" id="btnBackCourse">↩ 返回课程首页</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cover-help hidden" id="coverHelp">
        <ul>
          <li><b>AI 引导模式</b>：每一步张工先提问（如「接到项目第一步做什么？」），你自由作答，张工按要点点评并给出正确引导，再进入下一步。</li>
          <li><b>项目材料库</b>：定级报告、拓扑与设备清单、机房照片描述、漏洞扫描报告等材料会随进度发放，顶栏「📁 材料库」随时可查；填表前先读材料，从材料中提取答案。</li>
          <li><b>挑战一收官</b>：走完「解读定级报告 → 分析架构 → 确定范围 → 选取对象 → 确定指标 → 编制方案」六步法，系统自动汇总你的全部作答，生成一份属于你的《测评方案》；经你以项目经理身份签字确认后定稿，可下载留存。</li>
          <li><b>评分规则</b>：按关键词要点与关键数字评分（1~3 星），答错不扣分，可重新作答；答错时张工会针对性纠错（如 S/A 混淆）。</li>
          <li><b>串行解锁</b>：大挑战之间按顺序解锁——完成当前大关卡所有步骤后，下一关才解锁。</li>
          <li><b>自由选关</b>：每个大挑战内的关卡可任意点击选择，无需按顺序解锁；点击 ✓ 已闯过的关卡，既可查看复盘，也可选择重新闯关。</li>
          <li><b>方案签字</b>：挑战一收官生成《测评方案》后，需由你作为项目经理（项目第一责任人）签字确认，方案方能定稿；未确认前可随时返回重新检查方案。</li>
          <li><b>工具包</b>：右下角按钮可随时打开五级概览、S/A 矩阵、方案六要素口诀等参考资料。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="cover-foot">参考课件：1.1 等保2.0标准体系 · 1.2 安全等级识别 · 2.1 测评方案结构 · 2.2 编制完整测评方案 · 3.1–3.2 现场核查 · 4.1–4.5 测评实施 · 进阶与风险评估　|　授课教师：张玉</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 游戏主界面 ============ -->
  <section id="screen-game" class="hidden">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="proj">
        <div class="proj-ic">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 10-4.5-1.5-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z"/></svg>
        </div>
